{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51680","headline":"路次再感圣恩 · 钱弘俶","name":"路次再感圣恩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洪涛泛泛雨霏霏，芳草如茵柳袅丝。\n贴水碧禽飞一字，隔烟青嶂展双眉。\n南风入隙开襟久，西照临窗卷箔迟。\n惭愧圣恩优渥异，不教炎暑冒长歧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱弘俶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51680.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51680","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}